{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05151","headline":"和尹懋秋夜游㴩湖二首 二 · 赵冬曦","name":"和尹懋秋夜游㴩湖二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烟霭夕微蒙，幽湾赏未穷。\n舣舟待初月，褰幌招远风。\n鹤声聒前浦，渔火明暗丛。\n东山云壑意，不谓尔来同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵冬曦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05151.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05151","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}